# Dagric OS — Installer
# Calamares: the same friendly graphical installer Debian Live itself ships.
calamares
calamares-settings-debian
# Password-quality dictionary — without it Calamares' password check errors
# out with "error loading dictionary" and blocks EVERY password.
# (Found by the QEMU install run-through test.)
cracklib-runtime
# unsquashfs — Calamares' unpackfs module needs it to copy the live
# filesystem onto the target disk. (Found by the install run-through:
# "Failed to find unsquashfs".)
squashfs-tools
# The installed system's bootloader. The live ISO boots via live-build's
# own bootloader, so nothing pulled GRUB into the image — but the
# INSTALLED system needs it or the bootloader step fails.
# BIOS/MBR now; EFI (grub-efi-amd64 + shim) is a roadmap item.
grub-pc
os-prober
